  "text": "Listen, there's a flood management drill happening in your Rampur village. Everyone needs to gather at the school by 6 PM on August 17, 2030. Also, everyone needs to bring two water bottles for themselves. If you need a ride, call 98765 43210. But keep one thing in mind: everyone should only move to a safe place if the river crosses that red mark. Do not use the Market Bridge at all."
